							<div class="person__biography">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row person__about">
						<div class="col-12 col-xl-9">
							<h2 class="person__about-heading">About</h2>
															<div class="person__about-text"><p>Dr. Steven M. Greer is a leading figure in UFO research and disclosure, known for his work in uncovering classified information about extraterrestrial life and unidentified aerial phenomena (UAP). A former emergency room physician turned full-time researcher, Dr. Greer has dedicated decades to investigating government cover-ups, verified whistleblower testimonies, and the implications of contact with non-human intelligence. His extensive work has led to high-level briefings with military officials, government representatives, and the public on the reality of UFO sightings and extraterrestrial civilizations.</p>
<p>In 1990, Dr. Greer founded the Center for the Study of Extraterrestrial Intelligence (CSETI), an organization aimed at fostering peaceful contact with extraterrestrial beings through the CE-5 protocol. Three years later, he launched The Disclosure Project, a groundbreaking initiative bringing forth classified information from verified whistleblowers, including military and government officials, to expose the existence of extraterrestrial cover-ups. His work has also extended into alternative energy research to utilize advanced technology for a sustainable future.</p>
<p>Dr. Greer has authored multiple books, directed documentaries like Unacknowledged and Close Encounters of the Fifth Kind: Contact, and appeared on numerous platforms. His efforts have made him one of the most influential voices in the study of extraterrestrial intelligence and government secrecy.</p>
<h3>Education</h3>
<ul>
<li>Bachelor of Science in Biology, Appalachian State University (1982)</li>
<li>Doctor of Medicine, East Tennessee State University, James H. Quillen College of Medicine (1987)</li>
<li>Extensive studies in Transcendental Meditation</li>
</ul>
<h3>Career:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Licensed physician in Virginia (1989); worked as an emergency room doctor until 1998</li>
<li>Founded the Center for the Study of Extraterrestrial Intelligence (CSETI) in 1990</li>
<li>Established The Disclosure Project in 1993 to expose government secrecy surrounding extraterrestrial life</li>
<li>Created The Orion Project and Sirius Technology Advanced Research LLC to explore alternative energy solutions</li>
</ul>
<h3>Publications:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Unacknowledged (2017) </li>
<li>Hidden Truth (2006) </li>
<li>Forbidden Knowledge (2006) </li>
<li>Disclosure (2001)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Documentaries</h3>
<ul>
<li>Battle for Disclosure</li>
<li>The Lost Century (2023)</li>
<li>Contact: The CE-5 Experience (2023)</li>
<li>The Cosmic Hoax (2021) </li>
<li>Close Encounters of the 5th Kind (2020)</li>
<li>Unacknowledged (2017) </li>
<li>Sirius (2013)</li>
</ul>
<h3>TV Appearances</h3>
<ul>
<li>Ancient Aliens (2010-2014) </li>
<li>Disclosure with Dr Steven Greer</li>
<li>Deep Space (2017-2023)</li>
<li>National Report (2021) </li>
<li>CE5 Contact (2021)</li>
<li>America’s Book of Secrets (2023)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Podcasts:</h3>
<ul>
<li>The Joe Rogan Experience</li>
<li>The Shawn Ryan Show</li>
</ul>
<h3>Awards:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Two-time winner at the 4bidden Conscious Awards</li>
</ul></div>
